{"title":"Career Roadmap: Failure Analysis Engineer","role":"Failure Analysis Engineer","summary":"A Failure Analysis Engineer investigates why a component, material, structure, or manufactured product failed during service or production.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Metallurgical & Materials Engineering"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Develop expertise in investigating material/component failures, identifying root causes, performing metallurgical and mechanical analysis, and preventing recurrence"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Failure Analysis Engineer investigates why a component, material, structure, or manufactured product failed during service or production."},{"type":"p","text":"The engineer connects:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Failure","Evidence","Inspection","Testing","Metallurgical Analysis","Root Cause","Corrective Action","Prevention"]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical progression:"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Tech/B.E. Metallurgical & Materials Engineering → Materials Science → Metallurgy → Mechanical Testing → Fractography → Failure Investigation → NDT → Laboratory Internship → Failure Analysis Engineer → Senior Failure Analysis Engineer → Materials/Forensic Engineering Specialist → Technical Lead"}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof to Create","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"1st Year"},{"text":"Engineering fundamentals"},{"text":"Mathematics, physics, chemistry"},{"text":"Materials fundamentals report"},{"text":"Weak fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2nd Year"},{"text":"Materials & metallurgy"},{"text":"Physical metallurgy, phase diagrams, heat treatment"},{"text":"Microstructure portfolio"},{"text":"Memorizing metallurgy without interpretation"}],[{"text":"3rd Year"},{"text":"Failure investigation"},{"text":"Fracture,